      "categoryId": "24",
      "categoryTitle": "- Landing Homepage Articles",
      "introtext": "\t<div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"footer-logo\"><a href=\"home\"><img src=\"images/template/logo/logo-main-white.svg\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"footer-content\">\n<div class=\"footer-content-column\">\n<p><strong>Holy Cross</strong><br /><strong>4470 Hilltop Drive,<br />San Diego, CA 92102</strong><br /><a href=\"tel:(619) 264-3127\">(619) 264-3127</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-content-column\">\n<p><strong>Good Shepherd</strong><br /><strong>8301 Talbert Ave,<br />Huntington Beach, CA 92646</strong><br /><a href=\"tel:(714) 847-8546\">(714) 847-8546</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-content-column\">\n<p><strong>*TBD*</strong><br /><strong>2450 Mission Ridge Parkway<br />Vista, CA 92084</strong><br /><a href=\"tel:(123) 444-5678\">(123) 444-5678</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
